    <string id="REX_Speech2_Victim_Bold_4" text="那就看清楚。我不求怜悯。" />
    <string id="REX_Speech2_Victim_Fearful_Honorable_1" text="我的声音或许在抖。仍请听我说完。" />
    <string id="REX_Speech2_Victim_Fearful_Honorable_2" text="容我喘口气。我想尽量镇定些。" />
